* the same operating point without logopinfo
V1 vdd 0 3
R1 vdd d 10k
M1 d d 0 0 NM W=10u L=1u
R2 vdd c 10k
R3 vdd b 220k
Q1 c b 0 0 QN
R4 vdd a 1k
D1 a 0 DN
X1 vdd xd stage
.subckt stage top d
R1 top d 10k
M1 d d 0 0 NM W=20u L=1u
.ends
.model NM NMOS(VTO=0.7 KP=100u)
.model QN NPN(BF=100)
.model DN D
.op
.end
